{"title":"15FirstDates Toronto Downtown Speed Dating (Age 30-40)","startsAt":"2026-10-14T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-14T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**NOTE:** This is a paid ticketed event.\n\n**Tickets here:** https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/15firstdates-toronto-downtown-speed-dating-age-30-40-tickets-2001068113595?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\nGet ready to mix and mingle with other singles on short dates - and who knows, you might just find that special someone!\n\nNeed a date? How about 15 of them?\n\nJoin us for a fun and social evening of speed dating! You'll meet up to 15 other singles on short dates to see if there is a match.\n\n**\\*\\*IMPORTANT:** We are using our new web application, so please make sure you set up a profile at www.15firstdates.ca before the event.\n\nHow does speed dating work? You will meet members of the opposite sex for quick 5 mins dates, and then you will give them a Like or a Pass on your phone. They will then do the same thing for you. If there is a mutual match, you will be able to message each other the next day!\n\nWe will give you all needed materials, and explain the process to you once everyone has arrived. You don't need to bring anything - just come dressed for success and your phone fully charged!\n\n**This event is for people aged 35-45.** Get your tickets now while you can!","venue":{"name":"Ace of Spades Lounge and Events","address":"536 Manning Ave Lower Level, Toronto, ON M6G 2V7, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.660397,"lng":-79.414754,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Do Stuff and Make Friends in Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/5/8/8/highres_536158760.jpeg"}